# Check text files out with LF on every platform.
#
# GitHub's Windows runners (and a stock Git for Windows install) default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every text file to CRLF in the working
# tree.  amilisp's reader treats a CR as whitespace, so the sources still
# load -- but a string literal that spans lines then carries "\r\n", and a
# test comparing such a literal against a file amilisp wrote ("\n" only)
# fails on Windows alone (tests/test_amiga_bindgen.lisp was the first).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Workbench icons (icons/*.info, scripts/make-icons.py) are binaries.
*.info binary
